§ `Illustrations`

`a dangerous dog (for illustrations)` MEANS DogProfile WITH
    `declared to be a dangerous dog (declared) under s 33E(1)` IS TRUE
    , `is a dangerous dog (restricted breed)` IS FALSE
    , `is a commercial security dog` IS FALSE

`a non-dangerous dog (for illustrations)` MEANS DogProfile WITH
    `declared to be a dangerous dog (declared) under s 33E(1)` IS FALSE
    , `is a dangerous dog (restricted breed)` IS FALSE
    , `is a commercial security dog` IS FALSE

§§ `43 -- illustrations`

`compliant person facing an enforcement power` MEANS `S43(1) Conduct` WITH
    `owner or occupier fails to facilitate an authorised person's (or an assistant's or interpreter's) exercise of duties` IS FALSE
    , `impedes, delays or obstructs an authorised person exercising a power or duty under this Act` IS FALSE
    , `fails without lawful excuse to produce a dog when required, or to allow its examination once produced` IS FALSE
    , `interferes with, releases or removes a seized or detained dog from lawful custody, or damages or destroys the structure detaining it, or attempts to do any of those things` IS FALSE

`owner refusing to facilitate a warrant search` MEANS `S43(1) Conduct` WITH
    `owner or occupier fails to facilitate an authorised person's (or an assistant's or interpreter's) exercise of duties` IS TRUE
    , `impedes, delays or obstructs an authorised person exercising a power or duty under this Act` IS FALSE
    , `fails without lawful excuse to produce a dog when required, or to allow its examination once produced` IS FALSE
    , `interferes with, releases or removes a seized or detained dog from lawful custody, or damages or destroys the structure detaining it, or attempts to do any of those things` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 43(1) offence -- obstructing enforcement or interfering with a seized dog` `owner refusing to facilitate a warrant search`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 43(1) offence -- obstructing enforcement or interfering with a seized dog` `compliant person facing an enforcement power`)

