    , `investigating whether, or collecting evidence that, grounds exist for the cancellation of an approval to breed, a pet shop approval or a dog supply approval` IS FALSE

`unrelated purpose` MEANS `S43B Authorised Purpose Facts` WITH
    `investigating whether, or collecting evidence that, an offence is being or has been committed against this Act` IS FALSE
    , `investigating whether, or collecting evidence that, grounds exist for the cancellation of an approval to breed, a pet shop approval or a dog supply approval` IS FALSE

